	(descr "QingPu WQP-PJ301BM 3.5 mm mono switched jack, vertical, PCB mount - the shielded 'Erthenvar' jack. Pads T and TN on the barrel axis at -4.8 / +3.3, two S shield lugs at x -4.7 / +4.7: the lug slots reach 5.2 mm either side of the barrel, so the land pattern is 10.4 mm wide before copper. Imported from clacktronics/AudioJacks (github.com/clacktronics/AudioJacks, rev 14a8886, MIT, (c) 2021 Barwise - see doc/AudioJacks-LICENSE.txt). Land pattern unchanged from upstream, which lists it as UNTESTED: check against the part before fabbing.")
